/* RiscRTE privileged OS/CPU ABI v1: exact compatibility symbols.
 * Include with RISC_OS_CPU_SYMBOL(name) defined. This is an ABI inventory,
 * NOT a globally registered loader export list. No peripheral implementation
 * belongs here. Changes to the inventory require a new ABI version/audit.
 */
